# Three CI slots. Do not add a fourth Pkg.test / Aqua version job.
# Slide the pin; keep job names min / max / tip (branch protection stays put).
#
# min  Project.toml julia floor. Required. Pkg.test, Aqua, JETLS, docs, bake.
# max  Newest tagged or prerelease in versions.json. Required for Pkg.test, Aqua,
#      PR / weekly E2E controller, GHCR worker image.
# tip  Next-minor nightly. continue-on-error. No JETLS, E2E, or docs.
#
# JETLS has its own ceiling (aviatesk/JETLS.jl: 1.12.2–1.13). Do not point
# JETLS at max or tip until that runtime is listed. Raise this when JETLS does.
JULIA_SLOT_MIN=1.12
JULIA_SLOT_MAX=~1.13.0-0
JULIA_SLOT_TIP=1.14-nightly
JULIA_SLOT_JETLS_MAX=~1.13.0-0
